 in a position to  have to sign stuff into law rather than  having this long list of proposals that  will never see the light of day because  Democrats don't control the Senate  anyway so for me it's reinforcing hey  Biden's actually been pretty good on  climate for a long time and number two  importantly the importance of the Senate  to actually get some of this stuff in  front of Joe Biden to sign let me tell  you real quick about one of our sponsors  cuts clothing they offer super quality  men's t-shirts and they're giving you 15  percent off when you go to david  pakman.com slash cuts that see UTS  because solid color t-shirts are a  really important staple in pretty much  every guy's wardrobe I think it's really  important not to overlook the value of  having t-shirts you love wearing  t-shirts from cuts clothing have been a  game changer for me and as a company all  they deal with our men's solid color  t-shirts so they actually put a ton of  thought into the comfort the style the  durability of the t-shirts they make  they fit perfectly they're not scratchy  they don't shrink they don't fade they  don't stretch out over time like so many  other t-shirts they're really the most  comfortable t-shirts I've owned and they  look great this right here that I'm  wearing on YouTube is the split hem crew  neck t-shirt very soft fits me perfectly  it's the ideal length go take a look at  what they offer and once you have it you  are really going to see and feel the  difference their slogan is it's the only  shirt worth wearing you will see why and  you'll get 15% off when you do it by  going to david pakman.com slash cuts  that's david pakman.com slash c UTS

